<title>ARMENIA: SOCCER-TEAMS FOR ARMENIA V N.IRELAND WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TEAMS FOR ARMENIA V N.IRELAND WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>YEREVAN 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for World Cup group nine</p>
<p>qualifier between Armenia and Northern Ireland on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Armenia - 1-Roman Berezovsky; 6-Aramais Yepiskoposyan,</p>
<p>2-Yervand Sukiasyan, 5-Michel Ter-Zakarian, 4-Sarkis Hovsepyan,</p>
<p>3-Vartan Khachaturyan, 8-Garnik Avalyan, 9-Hamlet Mkhitaryan,</p>
<p>11-Karapet Mikaelyan, 10-Eric Assadourian, 7-Artur Petrosyan</p>
<p>Northern Ireland - 1-Alan Fettis; 2-Ian Jenkins, 5-Gerry</p>
<p>Taggart, 4-Colin Hill, 3-Steve Morrow; 7-Jon McCarthy, 6-Stephen</p>
<p>Lomas, 8-Neil Lennon, 11-Kevin Horlock; 9-Iain Dowie, 10-James</p>
<p>Quinn.</p>
</text>
